  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ") by hand and compare with ",
 StyleBox["DsRRules",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6403d197-a89f-4e79-8767-97ef4c846d18"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Solution", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"6ba020f0-98c8-4d65-a2a7-4c500f711a8c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "k ",
 StyleBox["\[PartialD]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "k gives (k ",
 StyleBox["\[Nu]\[Prime]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ") q",
 StyleBox["\.b2",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " r_n + ",
 StyleBox["\[Nu]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " q",
 StyleBox["\.b2",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " (",
 StyleBox["\[Minus]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "2 q",
 StyleBox["\.b2",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "/k",
 StyleBox["\.b2",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ") r_n",
 StyleBox["\[Prime]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " = q",
 StyleBox["\.b2",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " ",
 StyleBox["dsCoupling[nuk]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 " r_n(y) ",
 StyleBox["\[Minus]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " 2 ",
 StyleBox["\[Nu]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " q",
 StyleBox["\:2074",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "/k",
 StyleBox["\.b2",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " r_n",
 StyleBox["\[Prime]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "(y), the first rule of:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fd1bff23-f7b6-4793-bae6-211e2cee8fd9"],

Cell["DsRRules[regulator, s]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"7a931a35-3f94-4de1-a533-8bfa0140cfb4"]
}, Closed]],

Cell["Exercise: An unused shape", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"0df3f44a-f199-4805-aa5a-b537ea82b473"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Regulate only the ",
 StyleBox["h\:0304",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "h entry but declare both ",
 StyleBox["rn",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["rd",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 ". What does the card say? Is the result usable?"
